			</_properties>
			<_rmmServerID type="a">1143370_pDnuAbU4Ee6Ru6Ifm1D6NA</_rmmServerID>
			<_name type="a">SAF_P1_PCXD</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.19.2026::6:31:38</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect Physical Context Definition Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The Physical Context Definition Viewpoint identifies the various contexts the SOI is used in, along with the associated external entities sharing a physical interface with the system. For each context, the applicable environmental conditions shall be defined. The physical context helps identify the interface requirements needed to integrate a system into its environment in a given context.\par \pard\ltrpar Presentation:\par \pard\ltrpar A block definition diagram (BDD) depicting the elements available in a specific context. At least one BDD is used per identified context featuring\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 one block representing the Physical System, i.e., the system of interest\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 one block representing the specific Physical System Context\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 several blocks representing Physical Context Elements such as Physical User, Physical External System, and Physical Environment that are present in the Physical System Context\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 composition relationships attaching the Physical Context Elements and the Physical System to the Physical System Context block\par}</_textRTF>
				<Hyperlinks type="c">
					<IRPYRawContainer type="e">
						<IExternalHyperlink type="e">
							<_name type="a">Physical Context Definition Viewpoint </_name>
							<_textType type="a">FREE</_textType>
							<_target type="a">https://saf.gfse.org/userdoc/Physical Domain/Physical Context Definition Viewpoint</_target>
						</IExternalHyperlink>
						
					</IRPYRawContainer>
				</Hyperlinks>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">10.19.2026::6:31:38</_modifiedTime>
			<_lastID type="a">3</_lastID>
