re defined for each planned exchange on the identified interfaces. Note: Please use more than one IBD focused on different areas of interest to keep the view comprehensive. Note: Ports may be nested to organize interfaces, but it is recommended to use only only one level.\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A Table representing the content or part of the ibd content.\par}</_textRTF>
