			<_rmmServerID type="a">1143426_pDnuAbU4Ee6Ru6Ifm1D6NA</_rmmServerID>
			<_name type="a">SAF_P8_PFUM</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.19.2026::6:31:38</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect Physical Functional Mapping Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The Physical Functional Mapping Viewpoint supports the analysis of the assigment of system functions and system partial functions to physical system elements. The result shall be computed from the assigment of functions to logial system elements and the assignment of logical system elements to physical system elements\par \pard\ltrpar Presentation:\par \pard\ltrpar A FBS_to_PBS mapping matrix featuring\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 Functional Breakdown Structure (FBS)\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 Physical Breakdown Structure (PBS)\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 mapping (it is a derived relationship) from system functions and system partial functions to physical SOI elements\par}</_textRTF>
				<Hyperlinks type="c">
