			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">8.30.2026::6:4:51</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect Grid Definition Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The Grid Definition Viewpoint serves as overview about the of the Views present in a System Model.\par \pard\ltrpar Presentations:\par \pard\ltrpar  \par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A content diagram featuring a matrix view for the SAF Viewpoint conceptual model: Rows represent Domains, and columns represent Aspects, and the cells manage the Views.\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A table featuring the saf viewpoints, the views (diagrams, tables, ..) of the system model conforming to those viewpoints, domain and aspect information\par}</_textRTF>
				<Hyperlinks type="c">
