			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect EA Traceability Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The EA Traceability Viewpoint provides a mapping between SAF System Model elements and model elements of an upper Enterprise Architecture (EA) Model.\par \pard\ltrpar The mapping is accomplished by three kinds of relations\par \pard\ltrpar - a representation relation which states that an element of the SAF System Model and the related model element in the EA model represents the same entity.\par \pard\ltrpar - a derivation relation, stating that an element of the SAF System Model is derived from an EA model element.\par \pard\ltrpar - an informed relation, stating that an element of the  SAF System Model is related to the respective EA Element. \par \pard\ltrpar Presentations:\par \pard\ltrpar  \par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 One or more mapping matrices representing EA model elements and SAF model elements and their represents, derive and inform relations.\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 One or more tables containing EA model elements, SAF model elements and the represents, derivation and informs relations.\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 One or more BDD containing EA model elements, SAF model elements and the represents, derivation and informs relations.\par}</_textRTF>
				<Hyperlinks type="c">
					<IRPYRawContainer type="e">
						<IExternalHyperlink type="e">
							<_name type="a">EA Traceability Viewpoint </_name>
							<_textType type="a">FREE</_textType>
							<_target type="a">https://saf.gfse.org/userdoc/Architecture Management Domain/EA Traceability Viewpoint</_target>
						</IExternalHyperlink>
						
					</IRPYRawContainer>
				</Hyperlinks>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
			<_modifiedTime type="a">10.19.2026::6:31:38</_modifiedTime>
