lvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A tabular format listing the identified interfaces of the soi (ports), referencing interface definitions (port types) ,connections (connector) to system context elements, and information exchange (item flows) conveyed over these connections. It is advised to have multiple tables focusing on certain aspects to keep the view comprehensive, e.g. table focusing on contexts or on certain interface partners.\par}</_textRTF>
