			<_rmmServerID type="a">2261723_pDnuAbU4Ee6Ru6Ifm1D6NA</_rmmServerID>
			<_name type="a">SAF_C8_SCYM</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.19.2026::6:31:38</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect System Capability Mapping Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The System Capability Mapping Viewpoint describes the relationships of System Capabilities. The reasoning for System Capabilities as support for System Use Cases and the contribution of System Processes to Capabilities are described. Furthermore, the mapping of System Capabilities to Operational Capabilities are identified.\par \pard\ltrpar Presentation:\par \pard\ltrpar A tabular format listing the relationships of System Capabilities to Operational Capabilities, System Use Cases, System Process Activities, and System Requirements.\par}</_textRTF>
				<Hyperlinks type="c">
