				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1031{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\cf1\fs20 Implementation of \cf2\ul\protect Operational Exchange Type Definition Viewpoint \cf0\ulnone\protect0 \par \pard\ltrpar Purpose:\par \pard\ltrpar The Operational Exchange Type Definition Viewpoint captures enterprise wide concepts and collects type definitions for any exchanged item of the Operational Domain. Its purpose is to define these item types and their relationships.\par \pard\ltrpar Presentations:\par \pard\ltrpar  \par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A block definition diagram (BDD) featuring Operational Exchange Types and their relationships.\par {\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li360 A Table featuring Operational Exchange Types, their relationships and their Documentation\par}</_textRTF>
