			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.20.2026::5:53:15</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}%0D
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue255;}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs20 Released 2028-08-31\par%0D
- Renaming of Functional Domain and Logical Domain to Conceptual Domain\par%0D
- Renaming of Common Domain to Architecture Management Domain\par%0D
- New concept added for multi-model collaboration\par%0D
- Refactoring of Stereotypes\par%0D
- New TableLayouts added\par%0D
- Compatibility Profile added\par%0D
- Conversion tool from old to new model elements added\par%0D
- Conversion tool from old to new model structure added\par%0D
- Icons updated\par%0D
- Description of stereotypes updated with link to \cf1\ul\protect https://saf.gfse.org\cf0\protect0\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
